"P382384256" "You took out the Ballista, swinging the battle for the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3993674275" "The Sky Raiders have taken too many losses. Longbow may pull back, but they've won this day."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4038878018" "That should teach Longbow that they're not wanted around here. You did Brilliant work, {VillainName}, and we're very thankfull for it. Of course, you'll be well paid for your troubles, so I think this will be good for everyone."
// RandomFameString :
"P3441729976" "Did you hear about that battle over the pit? {VillainName} stopped the Longbow liberation force. Now we'll never be free."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2535431729" "What were you doing out there? We had to call in Arachnos to help threaten Longbow into retreating, but they know that they've won the day. It will take months of work to complete our airbase here, if we get the chance. <br><br>Fortunes of war, I suppose. Still, no sense crying over spilt milk, eh? Stiff upper lip and all that."
// RandomFameString :
"P2741266305" "I saw that battle over the pit. {VillainName} got beaten by the Longbow liberation force. Now I know we'll be free one day."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
